<title>INDIA: Indian Airlines Apr96-Feb97 loss at 987 mln rupees.</title>
<headline>Indian Airlines Apr96-Feb97 loss at 987 mln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-run Indian Airlines incurred a net loss of 987 million rupees ($27.6) between April 1996 and February 1997 compared with a loss of 1.23 billion in the same period a year earlier, the government said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the state-run international carrier Air India incurred a net loss of 51.1 million rupees in February 1997 compared with a loss of 425.7 million in same month last year.</p>
<p>($1 = 35.8 rupees)</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
